citation: |
  Aperio SVS whole-slide image fully owned by Toby C. Cornish / WSILabs and
  contributed verbatim for the wsi-fixtures corpus under CC BY 4.0 (attribution
  required). 20x scan, 23999x8015 L0, MPP 0.4967, 240x240 JPEG tiles, a 3-level
  pyramid with thumbnail + label + overview associated images. Unlike the
  single-level CC0 CMU-1-Small-Region.svs, this multi-level slide exercises the
  convert --to svs thumbnail/overview placement (SVS-thumbnail-at-IFD-1) and the
  associated label|overview remove|replace (rebuildSVS) paths.
